  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed single side extension, by reason of its scale, width, and proximity to the site boundary, would fail to appear subordinate to the host dwelling and would result in an overly dominant and visually intrusive form of development. The extension would appear incongruous within the surrounding area, causing harm to the character and appearance of the street scene. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD6, DMD8, DMD14 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
